SANDBOX

This folder holds test files, demos, and small experiments for trying
this repository's project out by hand. It is for playing with the
program, separate from automated tests (tests/) and developer helpers
(tools/).


WHAT GOES HERE

  Sample input files, interactive demo scripts, and throwaway configs
  that let someone exercise the program and see how it behaves. Nothing
  here is installed by make install, and make test does not rely on it.


IN THIS REPOSITORY

  Runnable demos for playing with tam-clam by hand. Run any demo
  directly from the repository root (it uses build/tam-clam, building
  it first if needed), or start with the menu:

    ./sandbox/play                   interactive menu of all demos
    ./sandbox/demo-0.0.1-basics      0.0.1: quoting, lists, builtins,
                                     and clear refusal of future syntax
    ./sandbox/demo-0.0.2-pipes       0.0.2: pipelines, !, &&/||,
                                     redirections, and here-documents
    ./sandbox/demo-0.0.3-vars        0.0.3: variables, prefix vs special
                                     assignments, parameter expansion,
                                     positional params, and tilde
    ./sandbox/demo-0.0.3-cd          0.0.3: logical cd (-L), physical
                                     cd (-P), cd -, and CDPATH
    ./sandbox/demo-0.0.4-control     0.0.4: if, loops, case, {}, (),
                                     functions, and FUNCNEST
    ./sandbox/demo-0.1.0-expansions  0.1.0: $'...' ANSI-C, $((...)),
                                     $(...), IFS splitting, and globbing
    ./sandbox/demo-0.1.1-jobs-traps  0.1.1: parallel &/wait/$!, traps,
                                     set/shift/eval/./exec/times
    ./sandbox/demo-0.1.2-builtins    0.1.2: printf menu, getopts, read,
                                     test/[, aliases, type/command/hash,
                                     umask, pwd, kill, ulimit
    ./sandbox/demo-0.1.3-options     0.1.3: set -e, -u, -o pipefail,
                                     -x with PS4/LINENO, -C vs >|, -n
    ./sandbox/demo-0.1.4-spec-fuzz   0.1.4: POSIX spec table, fuzz
                                     mutations, and self-dogfooding
    ./sandbox/demo-0.1.5-lint        0.1.5: tam-clam --lint FILE...
                                     and # lint: allow suppressions
    ./sandbox/demo-0.2.0-edit        0.2.0: line editor, arch/keys.md
                                     bindings, multi-line, bind builtin
    ./sandbox/demo-interactive       start an interactive tam-clam
                                     prompt with ideas to try live
